<!--T:4-->
The macro '''Spreadsheet Dependency Inspector''' shows, as an expandable tree, the dependencies between [[Spreadsheet_Workbench|spreadsheet]] cells, object properties and [[Sketcher_Workbench|sketch]] constraints: what each item uses, and what uses it. It also shows the items in error, and where the error comes from.

<!--T:5-->
The macro is multilingual, currently supporting English and French. The language used is the one you selected in your FreeCAD preferences.

</translate>
